https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9618910c-df56-424b-92f9-7f250642db53\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City_Sewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Lower City Sewers</a> in the trove of mirrors at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-76&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;864</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A smudged charcoal rendering of a smiling young girl.]\n</p><p><br>\n<b>MISSING</b>\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Misha\" title=\"Misha\">Misha</a>\n</p><p><br>\nReward offered for any information on beloved child, gratefully received at Gur encampment in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n<b>Now the fourth child to go missing. Any and all information desired.</b>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715160253\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27266/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6262/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930750/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.970      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.970      1 -total\n 58.71%   25.813      7 Template:Icon_text\n 52.37%   23.026     17 Template:Trim\n 25.76%   